OL,3,GNEWSAMore school places for SEND
OL,4,Achildren
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore school places will be created for
OL,7,FHerefordshire children with special
OL,8,Feducational needs and disabilities
OL,9,F(SEND).
OL,11,FThe government has given #9m to the
OL,12,Fcouncil which said it could also spend
OL,13,Fsome of the cash on making adaptions in
OL,14,Fexisting schools, or acquiring new
OL,15,Fland.
OL,17,FThe money has come from the Department
OL,18,Ffor Education, following talks over
OL,19,Fmore SEND investment in the county. It
OL,20,Fcomes eight months after the government
OL,21,Fpulled plans for a new special school
OL,22,Fin the county.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
