OL,3,GNEWSAMore school places for SEND
OL,4,Achildren
OL,5,
OL,6,FIvan Powell, cabinet member for
OL,7,Fchildren and young people, said it
OL,8,Fwould allow more pupils to "access
OL,9,Feducation closer to home".
